    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/80fb3fb5a9a1e44752fd46b75213774a.poster.avif?t=1750520958\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/80fb3fb5a9a1e44752fd46b75213774a.webm?t=1750520958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/80fb3fb5a9a1e44752fd46b75213774a.mp4?t=1750520958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Panda: The Quiet Path</strong> is a charming, atmospheric third\u2011person adventure where you play as a red panda exploring a scenic, tranquil forest.<br>No words, no combat, no rush\u2014just nature, silence, and a path that unfolds step by step. Immerse yourself in a meditative journey where the experience matters more than the destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> \ud83c\udf33 <strong>Atmospheric world</strong> \u2014 Explore a bright and cozy forest filled with natural sounds, soft colors, hidden trails, and unexpected discoveries.<br> \ud83e\udded <strong>Story without words</strong> \u2014 Everything is conveyed through the environment, visual storytelling, and sound. No text \u2014 only emotion and full immersion.<br> \ud83d\udc3c <strong>Panda abilities</strong> \u2014 Climb trees, roll, swim across rivers, knock down objects, and even fly with a balloon.<br> \ud83e\udde9 <strong>Gentle quests</strong> \u2014 Small, optional tasks gently guide your exploration and unveil new corners of the world.<br> \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Relaxed pacing</strong> \u2014 No pressure, no urgency. Go at your rhythm.<br> \ud83c\udfae <strong>Perfect for short sessions</strong> \u2014 A great way to relax and escape into a cozy forest world for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/a17854644ed3cb8caf39b74e27715947.poster.avif?t=1750520958\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/a17854644ed3cb8caf39b74e27715947.webm?t=1750520958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/a17854644ed3cb8caf39b74e27715947.mp4?t=1750520958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/80fb3fb5a9a1e44752fd46b75213774a.poster.avif?t=1750520958\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/80fb3fb5a9a1e44752fd46b75213774a.webm?t=1750520958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/80fb3fb5a9a1e44752fd46b75213774a.mp4?t=1750520958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Panda: The Quiet Path</strong> is a charming, atmospheric third\u2011person adventure where you play as a red panda exploring a scenic, tranquil forest.<br>No words, no combat, no rush\u2014just nature, silence, and a path that unfolds step by step. Immerse yourself in a meditative journey where the experience matters more than the destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> \ud83c\udf33 <strong>Atmospheric world</strong> \u2014 Explore a bright and cozy forest filled with natural sounds, soft colors, hidden trails, and unexpected discoveries.<br> \ud83e\udded <strong>Story without words</strong> \u2014 Everything is conveyed through the environment, visual storytelling, and sound. No text \u2014 only emotion and full immersion.<br> \ud83d\udc3c <strong>Panda abilities</strong> \u2014 Climb trees, roll, swim across rivers, knock down objects, and even fly with a balloon.<br> \ud83e\udde9 <strong>Gentle quests</strong> \u2014 Small, optional tasks gently guide your exploration and unveil new corners of the world.<br> \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Relaxed pacing</strong> \u2014 No pressure, no urgency. Go at your rhythm.<br> \ud83c\udfae <strong>Perfect for short sessions</strong> \u2014 A great way to relax and escape into a cozy forest world for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/a17854644ed3cb8caf39b74e27715947.poster.avif?t=1750520958\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/a17854644ed3cb8caf39b74e27715947.webm?t=1750520958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/a17854644ed3cb8caf39b74e27715947.mp4?t=1750520958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
